OL,3,GNEWSACall for international mediator to
OL,4,Aresolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,7,Fhas called for an international
OL,8,Fmediator to be brought in to try to
OL,9,Fresolve the Drumcree parade dispute in
OL,10,FPortadown.
OL,12,FSpeaking after an 80-minute meeting
OL,13,Fwith the Parades Commission, the
OL,14,Fcoalition warned the dispute could take
OL,15,F"months" to resolve.
OL,17,FThe Orange Order wants to parade along
OL,18,Fthe mainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road
OL,19,Farea on Sunday afternoon.
OL,21,FIt is one of the most contentious
OL,22,Fparade routes in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
